  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 1201.03 Notifications. Any notification required to be provided to the Winnipesaukee river basin program (WRBP) by this chapter shall be sent or delivered to the following address:\n\nWinnipesaukee River Basin Program\n\nFranklin Wastewater Treatment Facility\n\n528 River Street\n\nP.O. Box 68\n\nFranklin, NH 03235\n\nSource. #9798-A, eff 10-9-10; ss by #12739, eff 3-19-19",
